{"v":4,"catch":"戰略性的硬核射擊遊戲！","desc":"《BIO-SHIP PALADIN》是UPL於1990年推出的一款射擊遊戲。\n玩家可以使用各種武器來擊敗 Boss，包括帶有衝鋒和連環射擊的主武器、向十字準線發射的光束以及可以放大你的船的能量提升。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-08-05","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bab835ef11ddda76d8a0e997231138d4aef1640fdb3e3f115cb54cc89308e152.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5d738134e0fd0a31f07c6d863d75dad4f6944705fa3ff80644b73f9f873e2d28.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df870e903022e50736b8e4f9e604a63803eaeec131c2d5e173f8a7dac0aba690.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2b28e342271c24479ff357300f07eba133d25a9136a4b1e8ee72efcef4fd8e4f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/70433a3b285adacb6b80c749f95ce3e9ed6d42c8771f48bc46044a52c4058284.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0d95f5a8851c8207bae2b1c75c27dcd534050aafd7ea6db6f7e0f95a130a533c.jpg"],"titleId":"010011d01505a000","dlc":[]}